  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "I carried two sealed cans. I did not open them.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "I did not see a message. I worked from the access chamber below the paving.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "I have a claim card, not a ticket. 1978-0412. The orchard case is still on board.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "I never saw her face. Only the scarf.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "If the square is really burning, the street will say so. Get up. Look.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "If this is about the smell, I already called Sanitation. They sent me a complaint form instead of a cleaner.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "If you want warmth first, the laundry crew keep a fire by the west wall at dusk. Seline has been showing everyone something she found.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Inspect the broken lower feed.",
  "files": [
