  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · Every question has its paper. The punch is waiting.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · How many people does one claim number make?",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · Its face says seat 43. You have not read what it was in 1978.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · Lay one ticket on the other.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · Nika told us how terminals print duplicates. Her note is on this table.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · Now the other ticket, under the same lens.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · One claim, then. So why would the terminal print the second as VENN?",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · One claim, two cases: the city case and the orchard case. Count the passengers.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · One claim, two names. So why would the terminal print the second ticket as VENN?",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · One ticket's 1978 record says nothing about the other. Pin both records.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · Same claim, two names. If they are one thing, treat them as one.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · That holds. File it.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · The brass lens shows 1978. Try it on the tickets.",
  "files": [
