  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · The claim card agrees: one owner, two cases.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · The lens still works while you choose. Check what is under both tickets.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · The names differ. What makes these two tickets the same claim?",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · The oil was charged to the seat, not to a name. It says where she went, not who she is.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · Then show me.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · Two passengers on one seat? Look at where these tickets came from before you file that.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · Two passengers under one claim from 1978? Put their records side by side again.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · Two questions. Why are they one claim, and why does one say VENN? The first one first.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · What did the lens find under both tickets? Both records are on file at the top of the table.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · You are proving a claim you have not read yet.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "LEV · You have read one ticket's past. Only one.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Lev Ardin. Civic Movement Investigation Office.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Likely lamp oil and a stone solvent. The oil is fresh. The solvent may not be.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "Long surnames are cut:",
  "files": [
